providers/default-service-beside-a-named-one.toml is not a valid connector definition:
  - `[[services]]` declares "default" beside the named service "chat". Set `legacy = true` only when this is an already-published, address-elided service that must retain its old GID, OIP, credential address and unsuffixed artifacts while named siblings are added. Otherwise declare the roles and tags on the named service that actually has them
